---
import { Bot, ShieldCheck, Database } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section
  id="philosophy"
  aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading"
  class="py-20 md:py-28"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div data-reveal class="mb-6">
      <div
        class="mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-dark-border bg-dark-card px-4 py-1.5"
      >
        <span class="pulse-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-green"></span>
        <span
          class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wider text-text-secondary uppercase"
          >Future Proof</span
        >
      </div>
      <h2
        id="philosophy-heading"
        class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl"
      >
        How I build in 2026
      </h2>
    </div>

    <p
      data-reveal
      class="mb-12 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:text-lg"
    >
      The era of manual coding is shifting to agent orchestration. My workflow
      focuses on leveraging AI architectures to increase velocity by 10x without
      compromising quality or systems integrity.
    </p>

    <!-- Philosophy Items -->
    <div data-reveal-stagger class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Agent Orchestration -->
      <div
        class="group card-hover rounded-2xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card p-6 hover:border-accent-green/30 md:p-8"
      >
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-green/10"
          >
            <Bot
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="icon-float h-6 w-6 text-accent-green"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">
              Orquestación de Contexto Modular
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
              Diseñé e implementé una metodología de Orquestación de Contexto
              Modular mediante archivos de definición (Agents.md / Skills.md),
              logrando que modelos de IA actúen con precisión quirúrgica según
              el dominio técnico (React, .NET, Arquitectura).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Automated Governance -->
      <div
        class="group card-hover rounded-2xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card p-6 hover:border-accent-blue/30 md:p-8"
      >
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-blue/10"
          >
            <ShieldCheck
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="icon-float h-6 w-6 text-accent-blue"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">
              Gobernanza Automatizada
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
              Implementing AI-driven CI/CD gates that analyze architectural
              drift and security vulnerabilities in real time before code ever
              hits the staging environment.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
